The amount of karambwanji caught depends on the player's Fishing level, increasing every five levels. The exact formula is <math display='inline'>\left\lfloor \frac{1}{5} \times \mathit{FishingLevel} \right\rfloor + 1</math>, meaning players with a Fishing level of 95 or above will catch 20 karambwanji at a time, and boosting beyond 99 will result in 21 karambwanji caught per catch. 

